Package: simcyto
Title: Simulate Cytometry Data for Testing and Benchmarking
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person("Miguel", "Rodo", , "miguel.rodo@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a simulation engine for generating synthetic single-cell
    cytometry data across multi-sample, multi-condition experimental designs.
    Users define phenotype clusters, mixture distributions (Gaussian, t, or
    t-plus-Gaussian), perturbations (sample, condition and cluster level), and
    marker transformations (identity, gamma, Gaussian, or skew-normal).  The
    resulting data are returned as flowCore flowFrame objects with per-cell
    ground-truth cluster labels, making the package suitable for testing and
    benchmarking of cytometry analysis methods.
